{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q413166","formula":"C₁₅H₁₈O₃","hill":"C15H18O3","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":18.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Santonin","ru":"Сантонин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Santonin is a drug which was widely used in the past as an anthelminthic. It is a terpenoid and an organic compound consisting of colorless flat prisms, turning slightly yellow from the action of light and soluble in alcohol, chloroform and boiling water. According to the US Pharmacopoeia, santonin occurs \"in colorless, shining, flattened, prismatic crystals, odorless and nearly tasteless when first put in the mouth, but afterward developing a bitter taste; not altered by exposure to air, but turning yellow on exposure to light.","ru":"Сантонин — широко использовавшееся в прошлом глистогонное лекарство; вышел из употребления после разработки более безопасных средств и не зарегистрирован в большинстве стран мира. Был открыт в 1830 году Калером и Альмсом. 2-3 % этого вещества находятся в незрелых цветках («цитварном семени») Artemisia maritima."},"fame":18,"pubchemCid":221071,"mass":246.3,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H]1[C@@H]2CC[C@]3(C=CC(=O)C(=C3[C@H]2OC1=O)C)C","inchikey":"XJHDMGJURBVLLE-BOCCBSBMSA-N","iupac":"(3S,3aS,5aS,9bS)-3,5a,9-trimethyl-3a,4,5,9b-tetrahydro-3H-benzo[g][1]benzofuran-2,8-dione","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"221071","atoms":36,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.528,"y":1.324,"z":0.562,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.74,"y":1.873,"z":0.261,"el":"O"},{"x":3.575,"y":2.013,"z":-0.591,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.544,"y":-0.762,"z":-0.387,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.81,"y":0.09,"z":0.63,"el":"C"},{"x":1.265,"y":-1.334,"z":0.319,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.105,"y":-2.212,"z":-0.297,"el":"C"},{"x":0.677,"y":0.097,"z":0.309,"el":"C"},{"x":0.406,"y":-2.291,"z":-0.563,"el":"C"},